<title>SRI LANKA: Central Industries 6-month net flat.</title>
<headline>Central Industries 6-month net flat.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Central Industries Ltd for the six months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			  6 months 1996	 6 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		111.34     vs	 92.36</p>
<p>    Net profit		9.20     vs	  9.14</p>
<p>    Tax provision	   2.62     vs	  1.67</p>
<p>NOTE - The company manufactures and distributes PVC pipes and fittings.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
